=== AVAILABLE AI MODELS FOR SUBAGENTS ===

**CRITICAL - Agent Tool Model Names:**
When using the `Agent` tool, use ONLY these model names:
- `model: "sonnet"` → Maps to kimi-k2.5 (general-purpose, default)
- `model: "opus"` → Maps to kimi-k2.5 (complex reasoning)
- `model: "haiku"` → Maps to kimi-k2.5 (same as opus, use for any task)

**DO NOT use:** "claude-opus-4-6", "claude-sonnet-4-6", or any raw provider model name directly in Agent tool - they will fail with API error.

Example:
```javascript
